infographic relation-dagre-flow-lr-badge-card
data
  title VRCT-VOX｜4つの責務に分ける
  desc UI・アプリ制御・外部推論・OS音声経路
  nodes
    - id ui
      label React / Tauri
      desc 入力・設定・字幕
      icon screen
    - id py
      label Python sidecar
      desc Main → Controller
      icon code
    - id text
      label 既存の文字処理
      desc 翻訳・履歴・overlay
      icon text
    - id engine
      label speech.cpp
      desc TTS / ASR / VAD
      icon chip
    - id os
      label OS音声経路
      desc Linux：PipeWire
      icon route
    - id chat
      label VRChat Chatbox
      desc 文字の表示
      icon text
    - id voice
      label VRChat マイク
      desc 音声の入力
      icon mic
  relations
    ui - JSON -> py
    py - 文字 -> text
    py - HTTP / WS -> engine
    engine - TTS音声 -> os
    text - OSC -> chat
    os - 仮想マイク -> voice
theme
  palette #176b80 #42659b #665fa4 #217d65 #a46e20
  base
    text
      font-family Noto Sans CJK JP, Yu Gothic, sans-serif
